      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "As voice becomes a first-class modality for AI, Deepgram’s models span speech-to-text, text-to-speech, and voice agents.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-deepgram-optimized-voice-ai-at-scale-with-aws-trainium/",
