      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "That made inference efficiency a natural target and Deepgram turned to AWS AI chips to improve it.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-deepgram-optimized-voice-ai-at-scale-with-aws-trainium/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-19T16:23:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T00:39:19.165Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "They worked with AWS to bring its Nova-3 speech-to-text model to AWS Trainium2 for offline batch workloads such as contact-center analytics and medical transcription.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-deepgram-optimized-voice-ai-at-scale-with-aws-trainium/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-19T16:23:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T00:39:19.165Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The engagement began with Deepgram delivering Nova-3 as standard PyTorch code.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-deepgram-optimized-voice-ai-at-scale-with-aws-trainium/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-19T16:23:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T00:39:19.165Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Over several months, Deepgram and the AWS Forward Deployed Engineering (FDE) team ported Nova-3 to AWS Trainium2 in PyTorch reconstruction and tuned it for the new hardware.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-deepgram-optimized-voice-ai-at-scale-with-aws-trainium/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-19T16:23:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T00:39:19.165Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "On Deepgram’s offline, throughput-oriented batch workloads, that setup processed 11–70 percent more audio per dollar than the compute options Deepgram had been running.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-deepgram-optimized-voice-ai-at-scale-with-aws-trainium/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-19T16:23:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T00:39:19.165Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
